      en: ["Construction work on the church lasted from 1844 to 1848.", "The design was created by the renowned architect Carl Ludvig Engel.", "The church has a seating capacity of approximately 1,250 seats.", "The altarpiece was created by the Finnish painter Berndt Godenhjelm.", "The church is constructed as a cruciform church with a central dome.", "Lapinlahti is located in the North Savo province in Eastern Finland."],
