      en: ["The railway line to Porvoo was opened in 1874.", "The wooden station building dates back to the inauguration year 1874.", "Regular passenger traffic officially ceased on May 31, 1981.", "The tracks are currently used by museum trains during the summer.", "The station area is designated as a nationally significant heritage site.", "The distance of the rail line to Kerava is exactly 33 kilometers."],
